{"id":"n85907-2-8","stage":3,"title":"형식 · 形式","scene":"情境对话","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n85907-2-8-1","ko":"보고서 양식이 따로 있나요?","zh":"有专门的报告格式吗？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"보고서","meaning":"报告书","explanation":"보고서：报告书。","readings":[{"term":"보고서","audio":"/audio/01a64adf7f1500650cfd.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"59656","senseId":"1","lemma":"보고서","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"보고서","audio":"/audio/01a64adf7f1500650cfd.mp3"}},{"text":"양식이","meaning":"样式，格式","explanation":"양식：样式，格式；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"양식","audio":"/audio/16a8daf54141ac16e046.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"24028","senseId":"1","lemma":"양식","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"양식이","audio":"/audio/2daca33b1d4de2d75904.mp3"}},{"text":"따로","meaning":"分开，单独","explanation":"따로：分开，单独。","readings":[{"term":"따로","audio":"/audio/6d325aa9f77b0fc574c1.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"49672","senseId":"1","lemma":"따로","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"따로","audio":"/audio/6d325aa9f77b0fc574c1.mp3"}},{"text":"있나요?","meaning":"有","explanation":"있다：有；나요：礼貌、委婉地询问。","readings":[{"term":"있다","audio":"/audio/96fe52db2531c9e73e53.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"68797","senseId":"2","lemma":"있다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"있나요","audio":"/audio/0eb260e471116d837abb.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"01a64adf7f150065","term":"보고서","zh":"报告书","audio":"/audio/01a64adf7f1500650cfd.mp3","entryId":"59656","definition":"告知研究、调查内容或结果的文件或文章。","pronunciation":["보ː고서"]},{"id":"16a8daf54141ac16","term":"양식","zh":"样式，格式","audio":"/audio/16a8daf54141ac16e046.mp3","entryId":"24028","definition":"做某事时所需的一定形式或方式。","pronunciation":["양식"]},{"id":"6d325aa9f77b0fc5","term":"따로","zh":"分开，单独","audio":"/audio/6d325aa9f77b0fc574c1.mp3","entryId":"49672","definition":"不与其他东西放或掺杂在一起。","pronunciation":["따로"]},{"id":"96fe52db2531c9e7","term":"있다","zh":"有","audio":"/audio/96fe52db2531c9e73e53.mp3","entryId":"68797","definition":"事实或现象存在。","pronunciation":["읻따"]}],"audio":"/audio/57ebbf9ad0ad6e37dfaf.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n85907-2-8-2","ko":"그런 건 따로 없으니까 주제에 맞게 자유로운 형식으로 쓰세요.","zh":"没有那种专门的格式，请根据主题用灵活的形式来写。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"그런","meaning":"那种，那样","explanation":"그런：那种，那样。","readings":[{"term":"그런","audio":"/audio/d14f5bfb24390ed9c4da.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"60341","senseId":"1","lemma":"그런","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"그런","audio":"/audio/d14f5bfb24390ed9c4da.mp3"}},{"text":"건","meaning":"某种事物、现象或事实。","explanation":"거：某种事物、现象或事实；ㄴ：은/는 的缩略，标记话题或对比，如 난＝나는。","readings":[{"term":"거","audio":"/audio/ffcedfda7558e5dc31fe.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62331","senseId":"1","lemma":"거","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"건","audio":"/audio/f5fd44f22ad30ad631dc.mp3"}},{"text":"따로","meaning":"另行，别的，不同地","explanation":"따로：另行，别的，不同地。","readings":[{"term":"따로","audio":"/audio/6d325aa9f77b0fc574c1.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"49672","senseId":"2","lemma":"따로","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"따로","audio":"/audio/6d325aa9f77b0fc574c1.mp3"}},{"text":"없으니까","meaning":"没有","explanation":"없다：没有；으니까：提出原因、依据，或说明经历前一动作后发现的情况。","readings":[{"term":"없다","audio":"/audio/815560dcd5b828930ac0.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"89917","senseId":"2","lemma":"없다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"없으니까","audio":"/audio/995703f7577d3bfd7d95.mp3"}},{"text":"주제에","meaning":"主题","explanation":"주제：主题；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。","readings":[{"term":"주제","audio":"/audio/09053ac2411bc4cdd44c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"91771","senseId":"1","lemma":"주제","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"주제에","audio":"/audio/2e0753f27ab6728af7ed.mp3"}},{"text":"맞게","meaning":"合，符合","explanation":"맞다：合，符合；게：使前面的动作或状态修饰后文，也用于 -게 되다、-게 하다 等搭配。","readings":[{"term":"맞다","audio":"/audio/6d08580e9b08815338a6.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"66231","senseId":"9","lemma":"맞다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"맞게","audio":"/audio/c3bb076cd0a1f673ec8c.mp3"}},{"text":"자유로운","meaning":"自由，自由自在","explanation":"자유롭다：自由，自由自在；은：修饰后面的名词。形容词后表示当前性质；动词后通常表示已完成的动作或结果状态。","readings":[{"term":"자유롭다","audio":"/audio/fb2ddc76ae7f4ad63c7e.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71198","senseId":"1","lemma":"자유롭다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"자유로운","audio":"/audio/2dd5247e6fdb7340e822.mp3"}},{"text":"형식으로","meaning":"形式，格式","explanation":"형식：形式，格式；으로：表示方向、方式、手段、材料、身份或原因等关系。","readings":[{"term":"형식","audio":"/audio/d1a42ea591bba8d27d7e.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"85907","senseId":"2","lemma":"형식","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"형식으로","audio":"/audio/bd169fa862d5714a42a2.mp3"}},{"text":"쓰세요.","meaning":"写，创作","explanation":"쓰다：写，创作；세요：包含尊敬形式的礼貌句末，可表示请求、劝告或询问等。","readings":[{"term":"쓰다","audio":"/audio/e5721a077be2e027ff8c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"65172","senseId":"2","lemma":"쓰다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"쓰세요","audio":"/audio/b667299362de3c582791.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"d14f5bfb24390ed9","term":"그런","zh":"那种，那样","audio":"/audio/d14f5bfb24390ed9c4da.mp3","entryId":"60341","definition":"状态、模样、性质等那个样子的。","pronunciation":["그런"]},{"id":"ffcedfda7558e5dc","term":"거","zh":"某种事物、现象或事实。","audio":"/audio/ffcedfda7558e5dc31fe.mp3","entryId":"62331","definition":"某种事物、现象或事实。","pronunciation":["거"]},{"id":"6d325aa9f77b0fc5","term":"따로","zh":"另行，别的，不同地","audio":"/audio/6d325aa9f77b0fc574c1.mp3","entryId":"49672","definition":"跟普通的不一样，比较特别。","pronunciation":["따로"]},{"id":"815560dcd5b82893","term":"없다","zh":"没有","audio":"/audio/815560dcd5b828930ac0.mp3","entryId":"89917","definition":"某个事实或现象在现实里不存在。","pronunciation":["업ː따"]},{"id":"09053ac2411bc4cd","term":"주제","zh":"主题","audio":"/audio/09053ac2411bc4cdd44c.mp3","entryId":"91771","definition":"在对话或研究等里，成中心的问题。","pronunciation":["주제"]},{"id":"6d08580e9b088153","term":"맞다","zh":"合，符合","audio":"/audio/6d08580e9b08815338a6.mp3","entryId":"66231","definition":"模样、气氛或取向等与其它对象相配。","pronunciation":["맏따"]},{"id":"fb2ddc76ae7f4ad6","term":"자유롭다","zh":"自由，自由自在","audio":"/audio/fb2ddc76ae7f4ad63c7e.mp3","entryId":"71198","definition":"不受拘束或限制，随心所欲。","pronunciation":["자유롭따"]},{"id":"d1a42ea591bba8d2","term":"형식","zh":"形式，格式","audio":"/audio/d1a42ea591bba8d27d7e.mp3","entryId":"85907","definition":"做事时的固定程序或样式；或指许多事物共同具备的模样。","pronunciation":["형식"]},{"id":"e5721a077be2e027","term":"쓰다","zh":"写，创作","audio":"/audio/e5721a077be2e027ff8c.mp3","entryId":"65172","definition":"将头脑中的想法或感觉等用文字记在纸上而使其现出来。","pronunciation":["쓰다"]}],"audio":"/audio/5fb566a98964cfa3552d.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":3.193,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=85907","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"2","sourceLevel":"중급","day":116,"sequenceScore":3.0197,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["没有那种专门的格式，请根据主题用灵活的形式来写。","你今天没弄干头发就出来了？","有专门的报告格式吗？"],"answer":2},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["没有那种专门的格式，请根据主题用灵活的形式来写。","有专门的报告格式吗？","你今天没弄干头发就出来了？"],"answer":0}]}
